    "title": "<p>The immunohistochemistry, chromosomal copy number, DNA methylation, and clinical profiles of cauda equina neuroendocrine tumours (NETs) are distinct from those of other paragangliomas</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Sebastian Brandner",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 703.3pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"938\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.4pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Features</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Extraspinal paragangliomas</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cauda equina NET</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 703.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"938\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Immunohistochemical</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cytokeratin expression</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Generally negative</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive with variable staining patterns</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cytoplasmic SDHB expression</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Loss of expression in most hereditary cases</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Retained expression</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">GATA3 nuclear expression</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">HOXB13 expression</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Negative</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Positive</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 703.3pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"938\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Molecular</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Germline mutations</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Present in as many as 40% of cases (most commonly of SDH genes)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Not present</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Chromosomal copy-number profile</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mostly aneuploid with recurrent trisomy&nbsp;1q and monosomies of 1p, 3, and&nbsp;11</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Generally a diploid genome</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Chromosomal losses, gains, focal amplifications, or deletions are extremely rare</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Fusion genes</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Present, e.g. <em>MAML3</em> fusion associated with poor prognosis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Not observed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.85pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"26\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 171.55pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"229\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Genome-wide methylation profiling</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 511.9pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"683\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cauda equina NETs are epigenetically distinct from extraspinal paragangliomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 191.4pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clinical</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Can be hormonally active and can show a clinically aggressive behaviour with metastasis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 255.95pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"341\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hormonally silent and clinically indolent with no reports of metastasis outside CNS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
